/-! # Factory glue for the Sixth source (gident2)

The short block of gforest's `sixthSrcVecW` is computed from the classification data; evaluating
the whole list in one kernel check exceeds 16 GiB.  Here it is given as packed literal lists
(`sixthLitShort`), certified against `sixthSrcShort` in three separate kernel checks (pairs,
octad blocks, odd terms).  `sixthSrcVecL w` is the factory-ready source vector with
`sixthSrcL_rep`; the numeric tensor bound `sixthSrcXW_bndN` and the integer matrix glue
`sixthSrcMat_act_entryZ` complete the factory interface. -/

